<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Pegasoft · Footer particles review</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/src/footer-particle-review.css"></head><body>
<header><a href="/">pegasoft</a><span>Footer particle motion · personal review</span></header>
<main><div class="intro"><h1>Dispersion and return.</h1><p>Hover or focus the wordmark. Tune the field size, outward motion and reassembly separately. Durations are the time to travel 95% toward the target.</p></div>
<section id="viewer" aria-label="Footer particle review"><div class="wordmark-frame"><canvas id="particle-wordmark" tabindex="0" role="img" aria-label="Pegasoft particle wordmark; hover or focus to disperse, leave to reassemble"></canvas><div id="pointer-guide" hidden aria-hidden="true"></div></div><output id="readout" aria-live="off"></output></section>
<div class="toolbar"><button id="play" aria-pressed="true">Pause</button><button id="sweep">Demo pass</button><button id="return">Return to wordmark</button><button id="hold" aria-pressed="false">Hold pointer</button><label>Speed <select id="speed"><option value="1">Normal</option><option value=".25">Quarter</option></select></label><label><input id="reduced" type="checkbox">Reduced motion</label></div>
<section class="settings" aria-label="Particle animation controls"><h2>Particle controls</h2><div id="controls"></div><div class="toolbar"><button id="reset">Reset proposed</button><button id="previous">Previous desktop preset</button><button id="copy">Copy settings</button><button id="export">Export JSON</button></div><pre id="preset" aria-label="Current settings"></pre><p id="status" role="status">Settings are a review proposal. Export the chosen values for approval.</p></section></main>
<script type="module" src="/src/footer-particle-review.js"></script></body></html>
